WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:04.507
When a candidate has no questions, I wonder if they really want the job.

2
00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:07.760
Ask what success looks like after six months.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.945
Ask what problem the team has today.

4
00:00:09.985 --> 00:00:13.609
An interview is a conversation that goes both ways.
